  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">for support of Ipas Africa Alliance</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This grant will provide core support for Ipas Africa Alliance, a member of the Ipas Impact Network, whose mission is to advance reproductive justice globally. The alliance works with partners to secure equitable contraception and abortion care in East Africa and to pursue advocacy for sexual and reproductive health and rights across Africa. This grant is aligned with the Global Reproductive Equity strategy. (Strategy: Global Reproductive Equity)</narrative>
  </description>
